{"s":68,"v":[{"t":"Nūn. By the pen and what they inscribe,","w":[["نٓ","Nun","noon","ۚ"],["وَٱلْقَلَمِ","By the pen","wal-qalami","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["قَلَمِ",1600]]],["وَمَا","and what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["يَسْطُرُونَ","they write","yasṭurūna","",[["يَسْطُرُ",4715],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"You are not, [O Muḥammad], by the favor of your Lord, a madman.","w":[["مَآ","Not","mā",""],["أَنتَ","you (are)","anta",""],["بِنِعْمَةِ","by (the) Grace","biniʿ'mati","",[["بِ",10],["نِعْمَةِ",247]]],["رَبِّكَ","(of) your Lord","rabbika","",[["رَبِّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["بِمَجْنُونٍۢ","a madman","bimajnūnin","",[["بِ",10],["مَجْنُونٍۢ",789]]]]},{"t":"And indeed, for you is a reward uninterrupted.","w":[["وَإِنَّ","And indeed","wa-inna","",[["وَ",1],["إِنَّ",15]]],["لَكَ","for you","laka","",[["لَ",8],["كَ",18]]],["لَأَجْرًا","surely (is) a reward","la-ajran","",[["لَ",23],["أَجْرًا",128]]],["غَيْرَ","without","ghayra",""],["مَمْنُونٍۢ","end","mamnūnin",""]]},{"t":"And indeed, you are of a great moral character.","w":[["وَإِنَّكَ","And indeed, you","wa-innaka","",[["وَ",1],["إِنَّ",15],["كَ",18]]],["لَعَلَىٰ","surely (are)","laʿalā","",[["لَ",23],["عَلَىٰ",19]]],["خُلُقٍ","(of) a moral character","khuluqin",""],["عَظِيمٍۢ","great","ʿaẓīmin",""]]},{"t":"So you will see and they will see.","w":[["فَسَتُبْصِرُ","So you will see","fasatub'ṣiru","",[["فَ",7],["سَ",118],["تُبْصِرُ",385]]],["وَيُبْصِرُونَ","and they will see","wayub'ṣirūna","",[["وَ",1],["يُبْصِرُ",385],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"Which of you is the afflicted [by a devil].","w":[["بِأَييِّكُمُ","Which of you","bi-ayyikumu","",[["بِ",10],["أَييِّ",71],["كُمُ",4]]],["ٱلْمَفْتُونُ","(is) the afflicted one","l-maftūnu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَفْتُونُ",4213]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who has gone astray from His way, and He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["رَبَّكَ","your Lord","rabbaka","",[["رَبَّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["أَعْلَمُ","(is) most